removeToken.t.sol
├── when caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with {OwnableUnauthorizedAccount} error
└── when caller is the owner
    ├── when token is not allowed
    │   └── it should revert with {PERPEX__INVALID_TOKEN} error
    └── when token is allowed
        ├── it should remove the token from the list of allowed tokens
        ├── it should remove the corresponding oracle from the list of oracles
        └── it should emit the {TokenRemoved} event
